yunohost (12.1.41.36) stable; urgency=low

  * nostrhost: unified single sign-in for the admin console (portal session).
    - The native API authorizer now accepts the nostrhost.portal session
      cookie as an alternative to NIP-98: the portal login authenticates the
      admin console too. GET /package/session reports the session identity +
      admin status so the SPA can decide to show the console or redirect.
    - All native API routes now live under /package/* (matching the Caddy
      /package/* route and the admin SPA's API base), so the console's data
      calls actually reach the API instead of the domain root responder.
    - /session and /healthz are the only public routes.

 -- NostrHost <noreply@nostrhost.org>  Sun, 13 Sep 2026 17:44:05 

